 "day_night": {
  "rule": "Every material reads in full daylight. The only emissive surface is the lamp glass (SS_LampGlass: flat warm `#ffc174`, the same warm amber as the repo's lantern glow, emission energy 0.65) in the lattice panes of the front door: it ships lit; by day the game scales `emission_energy_multiplier` down (to about 0.15-0.2) and at dusk back up. The assets contain no light nodes: put a warm OmniLight3D at `mk_light_l` / `mk_light_r` / `mk_light` at dusk, and (optionally) a small one behind `mk_pane_glow_l/r` on the inside.",
  "night_renders": "previews/*dusk* use preview-only lights; the assets contain no lights, only mk_light_* markers."
 }
